# The Basics (otherAreas 6): a full inventory at both item steps. Accepted (a GM), Prog 0, the couscous: Valgeir's 106
# with a full inventory: npcUtil.giveItem fails (ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED), yet the couscous is taken and Prog becomes 1
# (a kept quirk). A popoto given by a GM, the inventory full again: Rycharde's 96, finished: npcUtil.completeQuest cannot
# give the Tea Set: not completed, the popoto kept, no exp, no Commentary vars. Room made: 96, completed.
lists Selbina/Valgeir/onTrigger Selbina/onEventFinish/106 Mhaura/Rycharde/onTrade Mhaura/onEventFinish/96
char zone=Selbina pos=59,-15.27,20.2 job=WAR lvl=30
quest OtherAreas.TheBasics accepted
keyitem MhauranCouscous
login
fill-inventory
trigger Valgeir                         # Prog 0: 106
finish                                  # no room: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED; the couscous taken anyway; Prog 1
free-inventory
item BakedPopoto                        # a GM
fill-inventory
warp 19,-16,88.8 Mhaura
trade Rycharde BakedPopoto x1           # Prog 1: 96
finish                                  # no room for the Tea Set: not completed; the popoto kept
free-inventory
trade Rycharde BakedPopoto x1           # 96
finish                                  # completed: fame 60 Windurst, the Tea Set, the title; the popoto taken; 2000 exp
